 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” company, but **PV Heating, Cooling & Plumbing** looks like a strong first call for an AC replacement: it handles full system replacements and reports a 4.9 Google rating with 2,000+ reviews. **Empire Heating & Air Conditioning** and **The Air Company of GA** are also worth getting bids from; both are listed for Atlanta-area replacement work and have strong review records.\n\nI’d get **three written estimates** before choosing. Ask each company to:\n- Perform a proper load calculation rather than simply match the old unit’s size.\n- Itemize equipment, labor, permits, warranty, and any ductwork or electrical changes.\n- Explain efficiency options and the expected operating costs.\n- Confirm licensing, insurance, and who will do the installation.\n\nThe best choice is the one that gives you a clear, comparable proposal and can explain why the system is sized for your home—not just the lowest quote.",
